<title>POLAND: NOVITA FEB NET RISES TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>NOVITA FEB NET RISES TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.23 vs   0.11</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.42 vs   0.13</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.53 vs   0.32</p>
<p> Sales		    5.07 vs   4.25</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.27 vs   0.15</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.89 vs   0.22</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.24 vs   0.65</p>
<p> Sales		   10.76 vs   8.55</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish carpet maker is Novita SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
